  <item>
    <title>【年度特辑-4】跨境电商独立站的发展历程以及玩法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64227f868aca9099d782316e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64227f868aca9099d782316e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Mar 2023 05:47:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2020年跨境电商迎来了全新的蜕变，中国跨境电商在疫情下逆势增长。国家政府的扶持，海外仓的建立，以及跨境电商人的坚持，经过多年孕育和发展，中国的跨境电商经历了从业余到专业，从无序到有序，从PC到移动，从单一到多元的转变。当下的跨境电商行业，仍然有着巨大的机会等着中国卖家们去把握，但是行业边界正在逐渐清晰，卖家们正在历经“一半是火焰一半是海水”的痛并快乐着的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Maggie（花名：二姐 &nbsp;雨果跨境VP）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：June（大卖家）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">00:07:25</a>独立站的兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">00:08:37</a>独立站的经营模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">00:12:24</a>独立站和第三方平台的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">00:15:25</a>运营独立站应该关注哪些数据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">00:19:12</a>市场的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">00:22:37</a>新兴市场的魔力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">00:27:07</a> Top级玩家选择成熟市场的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">00:30:00</a>独立站的流量玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">00:35:23</a>海外网红如何种草产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">00:39:45</a>不同类型的卖家如何入局独立站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">00:44:09</a>未来的跨境电商会是怎样的局面</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>近期跨境电商活动推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoddBg5UsRF-UdnSps9t6MV3wFAn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>互动方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>搜索wx号“kuajingdongxuejie”，与主播交流出海经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：跨境她力量</span></p>]]></description>
