  <item>
    <title>【年度特辑-3】精品？团队？跨境转型十字路口</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64227e5673768bea359bfbfa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64227e5673768bea359bfbfa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Mar 2023 05:42:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着跨境电商的体量疯狂增长，行业的环境也开始复杂起来，市场上充斥着大量违规假货。2017年亚马逊、速卖通等平台开启第一次封店潮，大量违规店铺被关闭，铺货模式受到前所未有的挑战，“跨境批发城”时代结束，精铺或精品逐渐成为这段时间的主流玩法。从生存的角度看，卖家们是逆流而上，铺货到最后一刻还是顺应行业变迁，努力转型？站在十字路口，卖家该何去何从？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Maggie（花名：二姐 &nbsp;雨果跨境）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：李聪、Tina（大卖家）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">00:09:10</a>从粗放到精细化再到品牌化，卖家转型之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">00:17:40</a>发展中团队的培养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">00:20:24</a>跨境电商一定要做品牌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">00:22:14</a>品牌发展的基石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">00:23:40</a>高学历运营的优势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">00:27:27</a>如何发挥团队最大的效力，避免“内耗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">00:30:16</a>实用的平台玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">00:31:40</a>经营的核心是产品供应链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">00:37:25</a>如何与供应商打交道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">00:43:21</a>品牌从0到1的流量玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">00:47:15</a>网红营销怎么做？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">00:51:13</a>跨境电商行业的未来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>互动方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>搜索wx号“kuajingdongxuejie”，与主播交流出海经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：跨境她力量</span></p>]]></description>
