  <item>
    <title>【年度特辑-2】正中风口？跑车标配出街？看看他们怎么说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63feba41b91c17e69c88146f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63feba41b91c17e69c88146f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Mar 2023 02:36:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2014年1月份，国务院正式将线上外贸命名为“跨境电子商务”，跨境电商从此开启了疯狂的生长。同年，雨果平台正式上线。这段时间里，低廉的国内批发产品在线上可以卖出数十倍的价格，卖家们纷纷布局多平台或单店上架海量SKU，这就是铺货模式。迎风而上的卖家们都赚得盆满钵满，跨境电商行业里一度盛传“跨境卖家都开跑车出街！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Maggie（雨果跨境VP）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：大金、张翔宇（大卖家）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">00:03:58</a>跨境电商这十年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">00:11:05</a>疯狂躺赚的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">00:20:46</a>和“雨果跨境”的交集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">00:29:26</a>独立站值得一试吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">00:32:18</a>如何选择商品品类？怎么逐步深耕？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">00:38:42</a>人效管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">00:40:25</a>疫情后的经营之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">00:45:14</a>跨境电商的未来发展方向</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>互动方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>搜索wx号“kuajingdongxuejie”，与主播交流出海经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：跨境她力量</span></p>]]></description>
