  <item>
    <title>【年度特辑】拾年，向着跨境电商前进！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f4cf6de99bdef7d33a49c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f4cf6de99bdef7d33a49c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Feb 2023 14:04:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2011年前后“跨境电商”这个词取代“外贸电商”在媒体上逐渐出现，从那时起，一条“网上丝绸之路”显现。之后，国家开始重视这个行业，逐条法规颁布，2012年亚马逊全球开店进入中国，涌入跨境电商行业的人也日益增加。初期的行业很“懵懂”，每个人都在摸索，但是每个人都怀揣着希望，面对着一大片蓝海，跨境电商的号角吹响，中国卖家即刻启航，二姐也一脚迈进了这个“新兴行业”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Maggie（雨果跨境VP）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiZToLL7fIPxT0Av36PJlZG7WkdM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a>开春特辑四大主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">00:02:50</a>二姐结缘“跨境电商”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a>“二姐”的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">00:07:30</a>跨境电商的发展历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">00:13:15</a>四大主流跨境电商平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">00:15:18</a>早期跨境卖家画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">00:17:12</a>新兴跨境电商平台的崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">00:18:29</a>卖家疯狂“占坑位”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">00:20:18</a>爆火的独立站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">00:22:11</a>“中国工厂”的跨境初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">00:26:26</a>疫情给“跨境电商”行业带来的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">00:30:44</a>疫情下催生的机会品类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">00:37:02</a>跨境人的“七维”性格</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>互动方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>搜索wx号“kuajingdongxuejie”，与主播交流出海经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：跨境她力量</span></p>]]></description>
