  <item>
    <title>布局海外仓是中国品牌出海制胜的关键吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6364b49baede8fbdf6484e69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6364b49baede8fbdf6484e69</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Nov 2022 06:43:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>疫情以来，中国跨境电商业务突飞猛进，海外仓异军突起，迎来爆发性增长，一时间市场风起云涌，风口下诸多跨境从业者纷纷入局。海外仓作为新型外贸基础设施，是跨境电商海外布局的重要节点，尤其面对国内国际一系列影响供应链稳定的因素下，海外仓更是成为卖家抓住物流确定性的重要一环。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDneNknNid3HYVZjLCNotRsd7eT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>海外仓模式具体的运转流程和逻辑是怎样的？使用海外仓能为跨境企业带来怎样的好处？海外仓是中国跨境企业出海的最佳选择吗？如何选择靠谱的海外仓服务？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们来聊聊海外仓的那些事儿~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：二姐（雨果跨境VP）</span><strong><span> 嘉宾：</span></strong><span>Jerry（西邮物流销售总监）</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">00:03:21</a>什么是海外仓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">00:04:20</a>海外仓有什么特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">00:06:46</a> 货品体量不同的卖家如何选对海外仓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">00:10:40</a>虚拟海外仓是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">00:14:41</a>独立站和海外仓是强强联合吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">00:19:20</a> 中国制造转型做中国品牌的过程中，海外仓发挥着重要作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">00:23:05</a>中国卖家的销售速度和海外仓的发展速度能匹配吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">00:26:48</a>中小件卖家有使用海外仓的必要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">00:34:26</a>海外仓的物流时效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">00:37:32</a>海外仓的配套服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">00:40:11</a>海外仓在退换货上的相关服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">00:45:36</a>如何挑选合规的海外仓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">00:50:58</a>旺季应该如何备货海外仓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3413">00:56:53</a>未来海外仓的发展方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">1:05:48</a>第三方仓库和官方仓之间如何选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>互动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索wx号“kuajingdongxuejie”，与主播和嘉宾交流出海经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：跨境营销懂学姐</span></p>]]></description>
